慌。你怕被看透的，是那个不够稳重的自己吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2197,"promptTokens":3262,"completionTokens":93,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575662242417087,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e7bf4429d1fd72f6b04","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535035920,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e7bf4429d1fd72f6b04","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……可能更怕被看见吧。出错还能改，被看见了，好像就被人看透了。哎，我这么想是不是有点怪。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575662242417087,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e7bf4429d1fd72f6b05","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535035917,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e77f4429d1fd72f6af2","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"胸口一紧、脸一热、想缩回去——身体好像比脑子更快拉起了警报，先把你从放松里拽回来。这种警惕出现时，你更像是怕自己出错，还是怕被人看见？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"胸口一紧、脸一热、想缩回去——身体好像比脑子更快拉起了警报，先把你从放松里拽回来。这种警惕出现时，你更像是怕自己出错，还是怕被人看见？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2435,"promptTokens":2612,"completionTokens":122,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:11"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.025948493482687202,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e77f4429d1fd72f6af1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535031128,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e77f4429d1fd72f6af1","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"身体上……好像胸口会紧一下，然后脸有点热。就是那种想把自己缩回去的感觉。你说得对，我好像一放松就马上警惕起来。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.025948493482687202,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af66e77f4429d1fd72f6af2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535031125,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e72f4429d1fd72f6ade","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"开会时能开玩笑，其实说明你在那个场合是放松的；可笑声还没落，你就开始审查自己了。这跟你小时候“表现好才有笑脸”的模式很像——好像一松弛，就得赶紧把自己拉回来。那种后悔冒出来时，你身体上有什么感觉吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"开会时能开玩笑，其实说明你在那个场合是放松的；可笑声还没落，你就开始审查自己了。这跟你小时候“表现好才有笑脸”的模式很像——好像一松弛，就得赶紧把自己拉回来。那种后悔冒出来时，你身体上有什么感觉吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2519,"promptTokens":2601,"completionTokens":145,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:06"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690471831725077,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e72f4429d1fd72f6add","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535026014,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e72f4429d1fd72f6add","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"上周开会吧。我说了个玩笑，大家都笑了，可我马上又后悔，怕领导觉得我不专业。唉，明明气氛挺好，我却在那儿提心吊胆的。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690471831725077,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":4,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":3,"sort":5},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af66e72f4429d1fd72f6ade","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535026011,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e6df4429d1fd72f6acb","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"小时候躲进房间等家里气氛转晴，现在换成在别处等别人脸色转好——这个习惯跟了你很久了。最近一次你察觉自己在看人脸色，是在什么场合？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"小时候躲进房间等家里气氛转晴，现在换成在别处等别人脸色转好——这个习惯跟了你很久了。最近一次你察觉自己在看人脸色，是在什么场合？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2327,"promptTokens":2485,"completionTokens":121,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.017980984996735127,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e6df4429d1fd72f6aca","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535021212,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e6df4429d1fd72f6aca","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就……自己躲房间里呗，装作没事，第二天照常上学。其实心里一直悬着，等他们脸色好起来。现在想想，我好像到现在还是这样，先看别人脸色。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.017980984996735127,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af66e6df4429d1fd72f6acb","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535021209,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e68f4429d1fd72f6aaf","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"原来那么早，笑脸就是有条件的。一个孩子要靠表现好来换家里的温度，这份小心思其实挺沉的。我想问一句，考砸之后家里安静下来的时候，你一个人是怎么熬过去的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"原来那么早，笑脸就是有条件的。一个孩子要靠表现好来换家里的温度，这份小心思其实挺沉的。我想问一句，考砸之后家里安静下来的时候，你一个人是怎么熬过去的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2567,"promptTokens":2358,"completionTokens":158,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:56"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909679549206487,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e68f4429d1fd72f6aae","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535016622,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e68f4429d1fd72f6aae","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"最早……可能是我小时候吧。考好了我爸妈就特别高兴，考砸了家里就安静得吓人。我好像很早就知道，表现好才有笑脸。<第9轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":18,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909679549206487,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af66e68f4429d1fd72f6aaf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535016619,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e63f4429d1fd72f6a95","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“被否定就等于我不行”——这个等号连得很紧，几乎没留缝隙。你有没有想过，这个等号最早是在哪儿学会的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“被否定就等于我不行”——这个等号连得很紧，几乎没留缝隙。你有没有想过，这个等号最早是在哪儿学会的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1980,"promptTokens":2374,"completionTokens":109,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:51"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":17,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046089302097472515,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e63f4429d1fd72f6a94","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535011686,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e63f4429d1fd72f6a94","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"被你这么一说……我好像确实有点紧张，怕你觉得我事儿多。别人怎么看我，嗯……好像就意味着我到底行不行吧，我挺怕被否定的。<第8轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":16,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0046089302097472515,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e63f4429d1fd72f6a95","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535011684,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e5ff4429d1fd72f6a7b","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"我不会急着给你下结论。不过你连着两次问我“是不是觉得你怎样”，好像挺在意我怎么看你。这个在意本身，可能比“太在意别人看法”更值得看看。你自己觉得呢，别人怎么看你，对你意味着什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"我不会急着给你下结论。不过你连着两次问我“是不是觉得你怎样”，好像挺在意我怎么看你。这个在意本身，可能比“太在意别人看法”更值得看看。你自己觉得呢，别人怎么看你，对你意味着什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2031,"promptTokens":2243,"completionTokens":101,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690325606865606,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e5ff4429d1fd72f6a7a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535007400,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e5ff4429d1fd72f6a7a","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"从哪儿来的啊……可能就是从小听多了吧，我爸妈老说在外面要稳重点。不过……你这么一问，我倒有点说不上来。你是不是觉得我太在意别人的看法了？<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":14,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690325606865606,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e5ff4429d1fd72f6a7b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535007397,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e5af4429d1fd72f6a6f","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"不奇怪，这样的自我提醒很多人都有。我的提问是跟着你的感觉走的，没有固定模板。倒是“怕别人觉得我不稳重”这句，听着像你对自己有个挺严的标准。这个标准是从哪儿来的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"不奇怪，这样的自我提醒很多人都有。我的提问是跟着你的感觉走的，没有固定模板。倒是“怕别人觉得我不稳重”这句，听着像你对自己有个挺严的标准。这个标准是从哪儿来的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2577,"promptTokens":2117,"completionTokens":128,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:42"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575662746450699,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e5af4429d1fd72f6a6e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535002559,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:56:42","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af66e5af4429d1fd72f6a6e","chatId":"3d10313a8c9b43b19f8a5999ccf7312e","sessionId":null,"userId":99789,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就是……会想我是不是笑得太过了，别人会不会觉得我不稳重。哎，我这么讲是不是有点奇怪？对了，你平时也会这样提醒你的来访者吗，还是只对我这样问？<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":12,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575662746450699,"emotions":[{"cod